=====Usage notes=====
Before a word beginning with a vowel sound, {{m|fr|de}} elides to {{m|fr|d'|d’}}. Before the article {{m|fr|le}}, it contracts with the article into {{m|fr|du}}. Before the article {{m|fr|les}}, it contracts with the article into {{m|fr|des}}.
: {{ux|inline=1|fr|Le Songe '''d’'''une nuit '''d’'''été'|A Midsummer Night'''’s''' Dream|lit=The Dream '''of''' a night '''of''' summer}}
: {{ux|inline=1|fr|La queue '''du''' chien|The dog'''’s''' tail}}
: {{ux|inline=1|fr|Index '''des''' auteurs|Index '''of the''' authors}}

