===Conjunction===
{{ro-conjunction}}

# {{lb|ro|informal|or|literary}} [[if]]<ref name="if" group="conj note"/>
#: {{syn|ro|dacă<qq:most usual>|să<qq:relatively uncommon>}}
# {{lb|ro|with the {{lg|optative mood}}}} [[if only]]
# {{lb|ro|informal}} [[that]] {{gl|to the effect that}}<ref name="that" group="conj note"/>
#: {{syn|ro|încât|că<q:informal>}}
#: {{ux|ro|Am așteptat '''de''' {{nobr|ne-am}} plictisit.|We waited [so much] '''that''' we got bored.}}
#: {{ux|ro|E frig '''de''' a înghețat râul.|It’s [so] cold '''that''' the river froze.}}
#: {{ux|ro|Cum au jucat '''de''' au pierdut așa de rău?|How did they play '''to''' lose so badly?}}
#: {{ux|ro|Am bani '''de''' nu știu ce să fac cu ei.|I have [so much] money '''that''' I don’t know what to do with it.}}
# {{lb|ro|archaic}} [[while]] {{gl|whereas, despite the fact that}}
#: {{syn|ro|chiar dacă|deși|cu toate că}}

====Usage notes====
{{reflist|group=conj note|refs=
<ref name=if>In the meaning of “if”, {{m|ro||de}} is not typically directly followed by any word other than a verb, a pronoun (accusative or reflexive, but not nominative) or the word {{m|ro|nu||no}}. The more common and style-neutral {{m|ro|dacă}} is under no such restrictions.</ref><ref name=that>As an informal synonym of {{m|ro|încât}}, {{m|ro||de}} is used in simple constructions without any coordinative adverbs like {{m|ro|atât}}, {{m|ro|așa||so}}; therefore, a part of the sentence (“so much”, “so hard”, etc.) is missing and must be inferred. {{m|ro|încât|Încât}} and {{m|ro|că}}, while equivalent in meaning, require a coordinative adverb and so are not readily interchangeable with {{m|ro||de}}.

Additionally, in these constructions {{m|ro||de}} is normally directly followed by the predicate (including any reflexive prounouns, direct object pronouns or indirect object pronouns). Thus, {{m|ro||Vântul bate de se îndoaie pomii|The wind is blowing [so hard] that the trees are bending}} is a typical sentence, whereas {{m|ro||Vântul bate de pomii se îndoaie}} is at least unusual.</ref>|style=lower-alpha}}

===Preposition===
