# {{lb|ro|before spatial adverbs and prepositions}} {{ng|Indicates source of motion:}} [[from]].<ref name="from" group="prep note"/>
#: {{ux|ro|Apa picură '''de''' sus.|The water drips '''from''' above.}}
#: {{ux|ro|'''De''' unde vine sunetul?|Where does the sound come '''from'''?}}
#: {{ux|ro|Gloanțele acestea nu sunt bune decât '''de''' aproape.|These bullets are only good '''from''' a short distance.}}
#: {{ux|ro|Seara la ora de vârf toată lumea se întoarce '''de''' la serviciu.|In the evening during rush hour everybody is returning '''from''' work.}}
#: {{ux|ro|Ia plasa '''de''' lângă radiator! O să se topească!|Take the bag away '''from''' near the heater! It will melt!}}
#: {{ux|ro|O foaie de hârtie poate fi trasă repede '''de''' sub un pahar.|A sheet of paper can be quickly pulled '''from''' under a glass.}}
# {{lb|ro|before spatial adverbs and prepositions}} {{ng|Indicates source of origin:}} [[from]].<ref name="from" group="prep note"/>
#: {{ux|ro|Mâncarea '''de''' acolo e bună.|The food '''from''' there is good.}}
#: {{ux|ro|Pământul '''de''' sub Turnul din Pisa este prea moale.|The earth from under the Leaning Tower of Pisa is too soft.}}
# {{lb|ro|with adverbs of time, precisely referenced time-related nouns{{,}} or prepositions or conjunctions of time}} [[of]], [[from]], [['s|’s]]
