# {{lb|ro|informal|or|regional}} {{ng|Relative pronoun:}} [[who]], [[whom]], to [[whom]].
#: {{syn|ro|care}}

====Usage notes====
{{m|ro||De}} can replace any form of {{m|ro|care}} in the nominative, accusative and dative case.

* Nominative: {{m|ro||omul care a sosit — omul de a sosit|The man who arrived}}
* Accusative: {{m|ro||casa pe care o văd — casa de o văd|the house which I see}}
* Dative: {{m|ro||unul căruia {{nobr|i-am}} plătit — unul de {{nobr|i-am}} plătit|one to whom I paid}}

Genitive constructions cannot be expressed with {{m|ro||de}}.

Replacement of accusative {{m|ro|care}} preceded by a preposition is done with a resumption of the object: {{m|ro||filmul ''la'' care {{nobr|ne-am}} uitat — filmul de {{nobr|ne-am}} uitat ''la'' el|the film we watched}}. Stylistically this is much less desirable.

