* {{IPA|tr|/‿dɛ/|[‿d̪ɛ]|q1=colloquial}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|tr|ota|ده||tr=da, de|''conj.'' also, and, moreover, again}},<ref>{{R:ota:Redhouse|ده|page=929}}</ref> from {{der|tr|trk-pro|*tākı||''conj.'' and}}.<ref>{{R:tut-pro:SDM|*d(i)akɨ|url=https://starlingdb.org/cgi-bin/response.cgi?single=1&basename=%2fdata%2falt%2fturcet&text_number=935&root=config}}</ref><ref>{{R:tr:Nişanyan|de}}</ref>

====Conjunction====
{{head|tr|conjunction}}

# [[as well]], [[too]], [[also]]
#: {{uxi|tr|Özer '''de''' sorunun yanıtını biliyor.|Özer '''also''' knows the answer of the question.}}
#: {{uxi|tr|Berker '''de''' bizimle geliyor.|Berker is coming with us '''as well'''.}}
#: {{uxi|tr|Utku '''da''' dondurma yemeyi sever.|Utku likes eating ice cream, '''too'''.}}
# [[however]]
#: {{uxi|tr|Herkes iddia ediyor ki boyum uzamış '''da''' ben fark etmiyorum.|Everyone claims that I've gotten taller '''however''' I don't really notice it.}}

=====Usage notes=====
* Complies with {{w|Vowel harmony#Turkish|vowel harmony}}; takes the form {{l|tr|da}} with vowels "a, ı, o, u" and '''de''' with vowels "e, i, ö, ü."
* Although generally linked with the word before in conversations, the {{w|Turkish Language Association}} accepts the joined spelling of the word before with "de" as a misspelling.

